00:39:37.000 --> 00:40:16.000
proved to me that this thing was going to be a compromise. You say that the way we craft physical objects can teach us something about how to craft and make meaningful moments out of the daily events of our lives. And you call this moment making. What do you mean by this term? Well, the thing about making anything is, of course, is limitation. And this goes back to one of our big reframes on the meaning question is what we call the scandal of particularity, which is there is no perfect fire hydrant wrench.
向我证明了这东西将是一个妥协。你说我们塑造物理对象的方式可以教给我们一些东西，关于如何塑造和创造我们日常生活中的有意义的时刻。你把这叫做“时刻创造”（moment making）。你这个词是什么意思？嗯，制作任何东西的特点，当然就是局限性。这可以追溯到我们关于意义问题的重大重新构架之一，也就是我们所说的“特殊性的丑闻”（scandal of particularity），即世上没有完美的消防栓扳手，

