00:40:16.000 --> 00:40:35.000
there is no perfect birthday cake. There is no perfect conversation with Chakra Vedantam. There's only the one I'm actually in. So thing one, in making something, is recognizing its limitation. All ultimates are only really found in the particular. And they reflect that. They're not the fullness of it,
没有完美的生日蛋糕。没有与香卡·维丹塔姆的完美谈话。只有我正身处其中的那一个。所以第一点，在制造某样东西时，是承认它的局限性。所有的终极意义其实都只能在特定之中找到。并且它们反映了这一点。它们不是它的全部，

