but they reflect it honestly. And that isn't a problem. It's not, oh, I fell short again. It's not the perfect fire hydrant wrench. It's the real one. All the hours I spent making, this thing. It started a great big block of brass, and it ended up being a very specific thing, is it very much like sculpture, you know, like Michelangelo releasing the angel from the marble.
但它们诚实地反映了它。这并不是个问题。这不是“哦，我又没达到预期”。这不是完美的消防栓扳手。这是真正的扳手。我花在制造这东西上的所有时间。它始于一块巨大的黄铜，最终变成了一个非常具体的东西，这不是很像雕塑吗，你知道的，就像米开朗基罗把天使从大理石中释放出来一样。

