I'm in the process of releasing the wrench from the block. And if all I want is the end result, then everything I did up to that simply doesn't matter. And every mistake I make is in the way and a problem, as opposed to, yes, I need to pay enough attention that this thing will actually work when it's all said and done, that matters. However, was I present at the time? Was I actually noticing and learning how to use the machine tools? Was I noticing how a sharpened tool works differently than a dull tool? Did I understand the difference between brass and steel? Did I get the feel that I actually feel, and you can't, if you do this right, you can feel the metal cutting in your hands, and do you understand that experience? And now I'm actually being a maker,
我正处于将扳手从石块中释放出来的过程中。如果我想要的只是最终结果，那么我在此之前做的一切就都毫无意义了。我犯的每一个错误都是绊脚石和问题，而不是——是的，我需要给予足够的关注，让这东西在尘埃落定后真正起作用，这很重要。然而，我在当时是在场的吗？我真的在注意并学习如何使用机床吗？我注意到锋利的工具与钝的工具有什么不同吗？我理解黄铜和钢的区别吗？我感受到了那种真实的触感吗——如果你做得对，你能感觉到金属在你的手中切割，你理解那种体验吗？现在我才真正成了一个创造者，

